    "description": "An advanced post-laser and post-procedure skin recovery cream designed to restore, soothe, and strengthen compromised skin. Enriched with a powerful ceramide-based barrier complex, it helps accelerate skin comfort and recovery while reducing redness, irritation, and dryness after dermatological procedures.",
